WEBVTT

00:00:08.697 --> 00:00:10.337
-(LOUD THUD)
-Huh?

00:00:20.857 --> 00:00:23.217
I know, I know, I'm an idiot.

00:00:24.137 --> 00:00:26.777
-And?
-And a real numskull.

00:00:27.057 --> 00:00:29.737
-And?
-A selfish diaper baby.

00:00:29.977 --> 00:00:30.977
And?

00:00:31.177 --> 00:00:32.817
And...

00:00:33.777 --> 00:00:35.097
A stinkbrain?

00:00:35.337 --> 00:00:38.137
The stinkiest brain ever.

00:00:41.097 --> 00:00:43.457
(FANFARE)

00:00:48.657 --> 00:00:50.497
(CHEERING)

00:00:55.657 --> 00:00:56.937
(ENGINE REVVING)

00:01:00.577 --> 00:01:01.977
KING CANDY: (OVER PA)
My sweet subjects,

00:01:02.657 --> 00:01:05.897
I can without a pinch
of hesitation assure you

00:01:06.097 --> 00:01:09.017
that I have never been
so happy in all my life

00:01:09.257 --> 00:01:11.377
to say the following words,

00:01:11.737 --> 00:01:14.857
let the Random Roster Race
commence!

00:01:15.017 --> 00:01:16.457
(LAUGHS EXCITEDLY)

00:01:18.737 --> 00:01:20.497
(TIRES SQUEALING)

00:01:26.017 --> 00:01:27.457
(CARS WHOOSHING)

00:01:31.777 --> 00:01:34.937
Okay, remember, you don't have to win.

00:01:35.017 --> 00:01:37.617
Just cross that finish line,
and you'll be a real racer.

00:01:37.737 --> 00:01:39.777
I'm already a real racer.

00:01:42.377 --> 00:01:43.617
And I'm going to win.

00:01:43.697 --> 00:01:45.337
(ENGINE ROARING)

00:01:46.857 --> 00:01:47.857
(BEEPING)

00:02:07.977 --> 00:02:09.057
(ANNOUNCER SPEAKING)

00:02:14.417 --> 00:02:15.697
-Whoa!
-(SCREAMS)

00:02:16.697 --> 00:02:17.897
(ANNOUNCER SPEAKING)

00:02:17.977 --> 00:02:19.017
(CHEERING)

00:02:22.817 --> 00:02:23.897
(ANNOUNCER SPEAKING)

00:02:24.537 --> 00:02:26.257
Have some candy.

00:02:32.737 --> 00:02:33.737
(LAUGHS)

00:02:44.817 --> 00:02:45.857
Behind you!

00:02:46.937 --> 00:02:48.177
In front of you!

00:02:54.777 --> 00:02:55.777
Huh?

00:02:56.337 --> 00:02:59.017
-It's The Glitch!
-The Glitch?

00:02:59.297 --> 00:03:00.617
Light them up, Candlehead.

00:03:01.417 --> 00:03:02.577
(LAUGHS)

00:03:05.017 --> 00:03:06.897
ANNOUNCER:
What's this? Cherry bombs!

00:03:06.977 --> 00:03:07.977
(GASPS)

00:03:14.417 --> 00:03:17.217
I told you. You're just
an accident waiting to happen.

00:03:21.777 --> 00:03:23.257
(RACERS LAUGHING)

00:03:25.257 --> 00:03:27.377
(ALL SCREAMING)

00:03:30.577 --> 00:03:31.617
(VANELLOPE GRUNTING)

00:03:33.697 --> 00:03:34.737
(SOBBING)

00:03:34.817 --> 00:03:36.217
My candle!

00:03:37.537 --> 00:03:39.897
All right. Gotta keep it under control.

00:03:39.977 --> 00:03:41.537
No more glitching.

00:03:43.657 --> 00:03:44.697
Okay, kid. Let's finish this thing

00:03:44.777 --> 00:03:46.177
without any more surprises.

00:03:46.937 --> 00:03:47.937
Ow!

00:03:48.017 --> 00:03:49.537
Hope you're happy, junkpile.

00:03:49.617 --> 00:03:52.657
This game is going down,
and it's all your fault.

00:03:52.817 --> 00:03:54.337
My lady, you came back.

00:03:54.497 --> 00:03:55.737
Can it, Fix-It!

00:03:55.817 --> 00:03:58.577
That Cy-Bug you brought
with you multiplied.

00:03:59.017 --> 00:04:01.617
No. It died in the taffy swamp.
Believe me, I...

00:04:03.297 --> 00:04:04.577
(CROWD SCREAMING)

00:04:04.657 --> 00:04:06.257
Bullroar.

00:04:07.217 --> 00:04:08.217
(GUN POWERING UP)

00:04:13.137 --> 00:04:16.857
Listen up, people. Head to
Game Central Station now!

00:04:17.017 --> 00:04:18.857
Move it! Let's go! Let's go!

00:04:19.697 --> 00:04:20.697
Go! Go! Go!

00:04:29.017 --> 00:04:30.017
No!

